<article class="env-lemma" id="0FJ7">
       
      
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0FJ7">Lemma <span data-tag="0FJ7">10.15.8</span>.</a> Let $R$ be a nonzero ring. Let $n, m \geq 0$ be integers. If $R^{\oplus n}$ is isomorphic to $R^{\oplus m}$ as $R$-modules, then $n = m$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Immediate from Lemma <a href="/tag/05WI" data-tag="05WI">10.15.7</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>